# Tour on a phone (Safari/Chrome on a real device): tour-treechat.jevb with
# the mobile layout, where the sidebar is a slide-out menu opened from an
# unlabeled icon at the top left. Read-only: logged out, never posts.
#   jevb run examples/tour-treechat-phone.jevb --device "iphone 14"
#   jevb run examples/tour-treechat-phone.jevb --device "pixel 9"
open https://treechat.com/
check is a "Start Earning" button shown?
refute is an error shown?
scroll end
check is a copyright notice visible?
scroll top
refute is a copyright notice visible?
act click Explore in the top navigation
check does the page show a Public stream with Now, Hot and Top tabs?
refute is the page blank or still loading?
refute is an error or "not found" page shown?
scroll 1800
scroll -1800
act switch the feed to Hot
act switch the feed back to Now
act click the first Reply button
check is a sign-up form shown?
refute is a conversation thread shown?
act close the dialog
refute is a sign-up form shown?
act open the sidebar menu
act open the Channels page
check is a list of channels shown?
act open the sidebar menu
act go to Home
check does the page show a Public stream with Now, Hot and Top tabs?
refute is the page blank or still loading?
